Rule 1 (input tensor must have a floating-point data type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 6 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 3 (all dimensions of the input tensor must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (input tensor dimensionality must be non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 6 (input tensor must not have int32 data type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 3
